diff --git a/spec/temdd/TEMDD_VERSIONING_V0_1.md b/spec/temdd/TEMDD_VERSIONING_V0_1.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..9339864025b32d1b9ad7880b153105416062b679
--- /dev/null
+++ b/spec/temdd/TEMDD_VERSIONING_V0_1.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# TEMDD versioning
+
+TEMDD language versions are independent from repository releases. A language mutation changes the exact candidate subject and resets downstream evidence. Backward compatibility is demonstrated by executable corpus vectors, never inferred from version numbers.
+
+`0.x` denotes bootstrap semantics. `1.0` requires executable gates for all declared production backends, compiled formal obligations, reproducible packaging, Main adoption, and fresh production readback. A version label alone cannot construct STABLE_LANGUAGE or DONE.
